  CELL-DAL17-B
  affected neighbor relation set

prevent:
  competing optimization agent
  concurrent manual change
       │
       ▼
EXECUTION CONTROL
is action registered?                YES
target ontology type valid?          Cell / NeighborRelation
plan lease still valid?              YES
telemetry freshness within TTL?      YES
neighbor capacity still sufficient?  YES
active change still NONE?            YES
blast radius                         1 serving cell + approved neighbors
risk class                           HIGH
approval required?                   YES
operation id                         OP-RAN-8841
       │
       ▼
HUMAN APPROVAL
NOC reviews:
  intended traffic shift
  affected cells
  expected KPI improvement
  rollback / reconciliation plan
       │
       ▼
L4 — ACTION REGISTRY
STEER_TRAFFIC_TO_NEIGHBOR_CELLS
  target = CELL-DAL17-B
  action contract:
    bounded neighbor set
    bounded mobility-parameter delta
    TTL / expiry
    reconciliation probe

binding chosen by RAN environment:
  O-RAN / SMO API
  vendor EMS/NMS API
  NETCONF/YANG
